ost-tool` (`additional_context`) JSON responses.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_hook_stop.go`: Wired Cursor `stop` `followup_message` JSON response on unverified worktree exits.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_help_contracts.go`: Updated `nomos hook install` help text and examples to include `--cursor` and `--antigravity`.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_init_test.go`: Verified `.cursor/hooks.json` scaffolding across `executeInit` integration suites.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_init_git_test.go`: Verified `.cursor/hooks.json` staging in baseline governance commits.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_hook_six_upgrades_test.go`: Updated user-scope default target count assertion from 3 to 5 providers.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_hook_cursor_test.go`: Added table-driven unit tests binding `@verifies TC-HOOK-002` and `@verifies TC-HOOK-003` across 5-provider parity, `--cursor` project/user additive merging, missing-binary fallback, `beforeShellExecution`/`preToolUse` blocking, `afterFileEdit` AST radar, and `stop` gating.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/verify/intent_obligations_sibling.go`: Added `ResolveActiveWorktreeSpecRoots` and `ResolveTaskContractSpecRoots` to isolate unmerged sibling `SUB-*` twin specs inside concurrent worktrees.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/verify/intent_obligations_eval.go`: Wired sibling-twin contract spec deferral in `evaluateContractObligationChecks` and `checkStaleSpecObligations`.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/verify/intent_obligations_test.go`: Added unit tests covering `extractWorktreeSubTaskKey`, `ResolveActiveWorktreeSpecRoots`, and `filterDeferredSpecRoots`.\n- `substrate/cli/intent_manifesto_obligations_test.go`: Scoped `TestIntentCharter_ContractSignatureParity` via `verify.ResolveActiveWorktreeSpecRoots` when executed inside an isolated `SUB-*` worktree.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_task_sync.go`: Scoped `collectSyncSpecDigests` via `verify.ResolveTaskContractSpecRoots` so syncing a task never prematurely seals an active sibling `SUB-*` task's unverified spec.\n\n## Verification\n\n- R